WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Is it just memory this time? No additional skills?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
There are no additional skills for fans to draw cards!

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
If the host needs additional skills in the strong benefit,

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,310
I can give you an extra small rubber racket to master!

5
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:16,310
What do I want that thing for?

6
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:23,444
The phone number is a white thing

7
00:00:23,444 --> 00:00:28,540
Please listen carefully

8
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:31,890
Huh? A virtual character created by Hutchison

9
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:36,900
He actually called me

10
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,900
How are you?

11
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:41,090
Why haven't you talked to Brother Sanqian yet?

12
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:43,090
Are you still angry at Brother Sanqian?

13
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:44,090
Heroiz

14
00:00:44,090 --> 00:00:46,090
Not at all

15
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:49,920
Thank you for your deep appreciation

16
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,920
I haven’t talked to Brother Sanqian recently.

17
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:56,240
Brother Sanqian, what’s wrong with you?

18
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,240
I'm wearing a passport

19
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:03,710
Brother Sanqian has been waiting for a long time, but I did not accept your invitation

20
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:07,870
So I want to ask you, where would you drive?

21
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:10,870
I will adjust my schedule well

22
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:17,330
Wow, what is this?

23
00:01:17,330 --> 00:01:22,330
I will go to the UK to discuss the recent agreement on population quotas.

24
00:01:22,330 --> 00:01:24,330
I will come back to Korea to visit

25
00:01:24,330 --> 00:01:27,330
I was wondering if I could wish you a birthday

26
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:32,330
But Brother Sanqian, you will definitely attend Heroiz’s birthday party

27
00:01:32,330 --> 00:01:36,330
Yes, I am still adjusting the suitable couples

28
00:01:36,330 --> 00:01:37,330
i will tell you

29
00:01:37,330 --> 00:01:39,330
He is waiting for your invitation

30
00:01:39,330 --> 00:01:44,330
happy birthday to you

31
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,440
Five-star hotel banquet hall

32
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:56,440
Dessert table, flower arrangement, meals and drinks

33
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:59,440
Lighting, sound, banquet planning team service fee

34
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,440
Half-handed gift

35
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:03,440
At least 570 million

36
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:05,440
I only have 60 million now

37
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:08,170
It doesn’t matter

38
00:02:08,170 --> 00:02:11,170
Birthday parties are a good time to receive gifts

39
00:02:11,170 --> 00:02:13,170
The gifts I receive then will definitely be worth a lot of money.

40
00:02:13,170 --> 00:02:15,170
I just need to survive the seven days before the banquet

41
00:02:15,170 --> 00:02:18,060
You have to continue to grow fans.

42
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:23,380
What's going on?

43
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:25,380
This is intentional
